            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:28:14.939496+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-low-r1-b15",
            "text": "I have inserted a clock into the presentations.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:28:14.939496+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-luna-low-r1-b15-semeval-8869",
