            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:28:14.939514+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-low-r1-b15",
            "text": "The Dickens Community Archive project marks the bicentenary of the author's birth.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:28:14.939514+00:00"
          },
          {
