            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:28:14.939516+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-low-r1-b15",
            "text": "The three-part Irish crime documentary series examined three memorable and notorious large-scale crimes committed in the country.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
